## B9.1 反射行向量

固定有限 prime cluster

$$
\mathcal C=\{p_1,\ldots,p_m\},
\qquad
\omega_j=\log p_j,
\tag{B9.1}
$$

以及正权 $w_j>0$。定义

$$
r_+(\delta)_j
=\sqrt{w_j}e^{\delta\omega_j},
\qquad
r_-(\delta)_j
=\sqrt{w_j}e^{-\delta\omega_j}.
\tag{B9.2}
$$

组成矩阵

$$
A(\delta)=
\begin{pmatrix}
r_+(\delta)\\
r_-(\delta)
\end{pmatrix}.
\tag{B9.3}
$$

令

$$
G(\delta)=A(\delta)A(\delta)^\mathsf T.
\tag{B9.4}
$$

